[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3120.63, "timestamp": "00:52:00", "text": "最好建議。如果你是印度人，如果你是來自印度的 YouTuber，想做轉載之類的，那就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3136.63, "timestamp": "00:52:16", "text": "不要把自己和任何社區聯繫起來，專注於你的粉絲群，你的成長歷程，你為什麼想做 YouTube，你開始這個愛好或這條路的理由，專注於此"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3146.41, "timestamp": "00:52:26", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that's truuuuue, plus I steer clear of drama, thanks for the advice Joq-san <3"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3151.91, "timestamp": "00:52:31", "text": "。是的，我的意思是，有人會說，然後談朋友，我們也會和朋友談這些。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3157.077, "timestamp": "00:52:37", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and potato-san too"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3168.47, "timestamp": "00:52:48", "text": "嗯，我的建議是謹慎選擇朋友，因為你永遠不知道誰會背後捅你一刀。  嗯，就像……嗯……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3177.713, "timestamp": "00:52:57", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Assassinated??"}]